WEBVTT

00:04.604 --> 00:11.806
Kashimashi
~Girl Meets Girl~

00:12.979 --> 00:19.714
No matter where
you are, I'll find you.

00:21.121 --> 00:28.152
I can only watch you...
I can't even talk to you.

00:28.261 --> 00:32.721
Today is going to end,
and we can't see tomorrow.

00:33.299 --> 00:35.927
But they'll turn into a gentle color.

00:37.570 --> 00:44.032
It whirls down from
the sky... Love will shine.

00:44.511 --> 00:52.543
<i>When I turn around,
I always see your smile.</i>

00:53.853 --> 01:01.259
1 wish a day like that would come.

01:01.494 --> 01:09.333
I want to keep
looking at you up close.

01:10.103 --> 01:16.565
I'm sending these great
feelings that never end...

01:16.776 --> 01:21.736
...straight to you.

01:43.236 --> 01:44.498
At last...

02:09.429 --> 02:13.422
Supplementary courses
are done. It's almost summer...

02:15.835 --> 02:21.467
The Bride and the Groom

02:39.759 --> 02:41.624
Tomari...

02:45.465 --> 02:48.559
<i>Oh, did I interrupt you?</i>

02:49.369 --> 02:52.702
What, so you two
are getting along now?

02:52.839 --> 02:54.067
Um...

02:54.340 --> 02:57.002
Ah, sorry about that. Sorry...

02:57.110 --> 02:59.203
ll see. So that's how it is.

02:59.312 --> 03:02.839
I see. I see.
Then I'm happy for you two!

03:04.150 --> 03:05.378
I..

03:07.453 --> 03:08.647
See ya.

03:10.557 --> 03:11.524
Tomari!

03:14.961 --> 03:16.121
Yasuna...

03:17.964 --> 03:21.798
Thank you for accepting my feelings...

03:29.676 --> 03:32.543
This is the way it should be.

03:37.650 --> 03:41.416
Hazumu always liked Yasuna.

03:41.688 --> 03:43.451
<i>For along time...</i>

03:46.526 --> 03:49.051
I'm an idiot!
Why am I remembering that?

03:49.162 --> 03:50.891
That... That was...

03:53.166 --> 03:54.394
Oh, Tomari.

03:55.435 --> 03:56.265
What?

03:56.369 --> 03:59.202
Do you have
any plans for the summer?

04:02.108 --> 04:05.271
You could spend
your vacation with me...

04:07.046 --> 04:08.911
I caught it!

04:15.188 --> 04:19.181
I guess it's difficult to control
your feelings when you're in love.

04:19.325 --> 04:20.189
Puu.

04:43.883 --> 04:47.410
Hey, Hazumu. What do you
want to be when you grow up?

04:47.520 --> 04:50.250
<i>I want to be your bride!</i>

04:50.390 --> 04:55.157
What are you, stupid?
Guys can't be brides.

04:55.261 --> 04:57.024
A bride...

04:57.130 --> 04:59.064
Don't cry!

04:59.465 --> 05:01.490
Well, let's see...

05:01.701 --> 05:05.137
A guy can be a groom. That's it!

05:06.005 --> 05:07.734
Groom?

05:10.543 --> 05:13.569
Then I'll be your groom, Tomari!

05:15.915 --> 05:19.578
I don't want a groom
who sobs all the time!

05:20.620 --> 05:25.455
<i>You can't even call that a promise.
How could I take it seriously?</i>

05:50.883 --> 05:51.975
Hazumu!

05:52.518 --> 05:53.712
Let's go!

05:54.587 --> 05:56.384
Good morning...

05:56.489 --> 05:59.356
Hey, hurry up. You'll be late.

06:00.059 --> 06:01.287
Okay.

06:05.164 --> 06:08.065
I guess you're feeling
much better now.

06:08.167 --> 06:10.032
Why do you say that?

06:10.136 --> 06:13.799
You finished several supplementary
courses, and now school's out.

06:13.906 --> 06:16.306
<i>I know how you feel, buddy!</i>

06:16.409 --> 06:18.673
Don't lump me in with you.

06:18.778 --> 06:20.837
Something better happened.

06:20.947 --> 06:22.471
What is it?

06:22.949 --> 06:26.578
I can keep it a secret,
but it's a really happy thing.

06:27.253 --> 06:29.050
Can I tell them?

06:29.589 --> 06:30.556
Ta-da!

06:30.690 --> 06:32.214
Here it goes!

06:32.358 --> 06:35.054
Hazumu is officially dating Yasuna!

06:35.161 --> 06:36.788
T-Tomari!

06:37.063 --> 06:39.156
Hazumu, is this true?

06:39.599 --> 06:42.124
That's not true! It's not like that...

06:42.301 --> 06:43.632
Don't be shy.

06:43.736 --> 06:47.194
You used to be a guy.
There's nothing wrong with it.

06:47.306 --> 06:49.240
No, I'm telling you...

06:49.342 --> 06:51.037
Stop being shy.

06:51.144 --> 06:54.978
You two should make some good
summer memories starting tomorrow.

06:55.081 --> 06:56.981
I'm rooting for you.

06:57.650 --> 06:59.845
Speak of the devil...

07:00.787 --> 07:02.254
Go on.

07:04.090 --> 07:05.785
Good morning.

07:05.892 --> 07:06.859
Yeah.

07:06.993 --> 07:08.984
See ya. Enjoy yourselves.

07:09.128 --> 07:10.618
Tomari.

07:11.764 --> 07:14.392
Let's hurry up and get to the roof.

07:24.577 --> 07:26.272
It's huge!

07:29.015 --> 07:31.381
Is this okay, Hazumu?

07:33.653 --> 07:34.779
Hazumu?

07:35.655 --> 07:36.747
What?

07:36.989 --> 07:38.980
Is this one okay to pick?

07:39.091 --> 07:40.251
Yeah.

07:41.127 --> 07:42.754
I guess you could...

07:51.037 --> 07:52.402
My notes?

07:52.538 --> 07:57.100
<i>Yeah, the teacher erased the board
so quickly that I couldn't copy it.</i>

07:58.144 --> 08:00.772
You can ask Yasuna, can't you?

08:02.315 --> 08:03.782
I knew it...

08:04.550 --> 08:08.281
By the way... the closing
ceremony is starting soon.

08:08.387 --> 08:11.356
Everyone, go to the auditorium.

08:12.358 --> 08:14.383
Tomari! Let's go...

08:14.494 --> 08:16.689
You go with Yasuna.

08:17.029 --> 08:19.224
Ayuki! Wait for me!

08:19.932 --> 08:21.900
Something's wrong...

08:29.175 --> 08:30.267
Tomari.

08:30.977 --> 08:33.104
Let's eat lunch together.

08:35.047 --> 08:37.538
Idiot! School's done for the day.

08:37.650 --> 08:42.212
Yeah, but I got a lot of
vegetables from the gardening club...

08:42.321 --> 08:45.415
Go eat with Yasuna.
We don't want any.

08:45.558 --> 08:47.458
But ll have a lot...

08:48.461 --> 08:49.792
Take it easy.

08:49.896 --> 08:51.989
I can't bother you two.

08:52.098 --> 08:53.190
But...

08:53.332 --> 08:56.460
Plus the sight might
be too much for me.

08:56.569 --> 08:58.469
Let's go, Ayuki!

09:15.288 --> 09:16.482
Sorry...

09:17.924 --> 09:20.484
I was mean, right?

09:21.494 --> 09:22.461
Yeah.

09:28.100 --> 09:31.797
Maybe it was
too much for two people.

09:32.405 --> 09:33.372
Yeah.

09:35.841 --> 09:38.435
But it's fresh and delicious!

09:39.612 --> 09:40.738
Yeah.

09:41.514 --> 09:43.880
Aren't you going to eat, Hazumu?

09:44.784 --> 09:46.342
Um, yeah...

10:08.107 --> 10:12.043
You were the only one in my heart.

10:17.717 --> 10:21.448
Thank you for accepting my feelings...

10:22.421 --> 10:25.390
<i>That's right. Yasuna and I are...</i>

10:32.531 --> 10:34.658
This is really good.

10:36.402 --> 10:38.632
That's eggplant inside, right?

10:38.738 --> 10:42.037
You have to tell me
the recipe. I get lots of them...

10:42.141 --> 10:44.905
...but ll don't know
what to make with them.

10:46.512 --> 10:47.809
Hazumu...

10:49.548 --> 10:50.606
No?

10:51.083 --> 10:54.719
Well, do you want to come over
after we water the plants?

10:54.720 --> 10:57.814
I'll let you borrow
a book with the recipe.

10:57.990 --> 10:58.957
Okay?

11:00.326 --> 11:02.294
Yeah. Okay.

11:13.372 --> 11:14.600
It's cold.

11:18.811 --> 11:19.971
It's cold.

11:20.079 --> 11:21.376
Hazumu...

11:32.425 --> 11:34.256
It's summer...

11:47.206 --> 11:48.173
Here.

11:49.475 --> 11:50.601
Thanks.

11:52.778 --> 11:55.269
Don't worry. She's usually quiet.

11:55.414 --> 11:57.279
Be quiet, Fermata.

11:59.852 --> 12:00.876
Hey!

12:01.620 --> 12:03.918
Don't be rude to the guest!

12:05.024 --> 12:06.855
No, Fermata.

12:07.493 --> 12:09.688
Fermata likes you a lot.

12:09.795 --> 12:11.194
Yeah...

12:13.332 --> 12:15.163
No, Fermata!

12:23.242 --> 12:24.766
Sorry...

12:25.644 --> 12:27.544
Fermata!

12:27.813 --> 12:29.940
Maybe it's hungry?

12:30.249 --> 12:32.649
<i>But this morning, I did feed...</i>

12:33.185 --> 12:36.484
Oh, that's right!
I was in a rush, so I forgot.

12:36.589 --> 12:38.386
I'm sorry, Fermata.

12:38.524 --> 12:40.754
I'll prepare your food.

12:45.097 --> 12:47.065
Karaoke

12:55.841 --> 12:59.072
That's enough!
You sang seven songs in a row!

12:59.979 --> 13:03.437
<i>You canceled all
the songs that I reserved.</i>

13:05.217 --> 13:07.310
Besides, you guys were...

13:07.419 --> 13:08.613
Shut up!

13:10.222 --> 13:12.156
I'm going to sing more!

13:12.291 --> 13:13.383
Next!

13:17.463 --> 13:18.430
Yes?

13:19.431 --> 13:20.557
Extend it?

13:20.666 --> 13:24.534
Of course! We can even
do two or three hours...

13:25.204 --> 13:27.502
We're finished. Yes.

13:29.341 --> 13:30.501
You...

13:31.243 --> 13:34.735
You can't escape ho matter
how many songs you sing.

13:36.048 --> 13:39.347
You're the one who
decided to get on the stage.

13:43.856 --> 13:46.120
Well, let's see...

13:46.358 --> 13:49.418
I'll place this here and... checkmate.

13:54.433 --> 13:55.457
Well...

13:55.568 --> 13:56.535
Well?

13:57.036 --> 13:57.603
You win...

13:57.603 --> 13:59.002
You win...
Yay!

13:59.438 --> 14:01.998
<i>Okay, I won't lose this time.</i>

14:03.642 --> 14:04.870
Come on.

14:15.087 --> 14:16.054
Huh?

14:17.189 --> 14:18.713
I have this too.

14:19.058 --> 14:22.459
Really? I've liked
that one for a long time.

14:22.628 --> 14:26.530
<i>Me too. I listen to it
after taking a bath.</i>

14:28.100 --> 14:29.158
Me too!

14:29.401 --> 14:32.632
I listen to it while
reading before bedtime.

14:32.738 --> 14:36.674
Then maybe we were listening
to it around the same time.

14:36.775 --> 14:37.742
Yeah.

14:38.844 --> 14:41.506
We should've talked more.

14:42.348 --> 14:48.344
We should've talked about our favorite
music, books, even our concerns...

14:50.089 --> 14:54.321
I saw you angry for
the very first time today.

14:54.760 --> 14:59.459
<i>When I saw you looking
flustered or joking around...</i>

14:59.698 --> 15:03.065
.--1 felt a little closer to you.

15:05.337 --> 15:06.827
Hey, Yasuna...

15:06.972 --> 15:11.909
We still have plenty of time. We
should talk about things little by little.

15:13.612 --> 15:14.874
Hazumu...

15:16.815 --> 15:20.478
Thanks.
We have plenty of time, don't we?

15:20.619 --> 15:21.586
Yeah.

15:40.039 --> 15:41.006
What?

15:41.140 --> 15:42.368
Nothing...

15:51.884 --> 15:53.181
Hazumu?

15:55.054 --> 15:56.112
Sorry.

16:00.693 --> 16:02.627
This is my chance!

16:03.162 --> 16:07.428
My wife is out having a meeting
with the neighborhood association.

16:07.566 --> 16:09.830
Finally, the time has come!

16:11.170 --> 16:14.333
Father, do any areas itch?

16:15.307 --> 16:19.607
All right! Let's go! Private time
between father and daughter!

16:21.013 --> 16:23.675
Enemy spotted! Fire!

16:26.251 --> 16:28.481
My mission for Mama is complete!

16:28.587 --> 16:29.554
No...

16:35.861 --> 16:39.558
<i>Why did I see Tomari back then?</i>

16:45.838 --> 16:47.897
1 believe that was...

16:52.578 --> 16:54.512
Something important...

16:55.014 --> 16:57.346
Something important to me...

17:15.234 --> 17:16.166
That's it!

17:28.280 --> 17:30.942
I see. Thank you very much.

17:34.820 --> 17:38.017
Then I'll be your groom, Tomari!

17:39.124 --> 17:42.560
I don't want a groom
who sobs all the time!

17:55.240 --> 17:59.768
If you're not strong, cool,
and manly, you can't be my groom.

18:00.879 --> 18:02.278
Manly?

18:03.215 --> 18:05.342
That's right. Manly.

18:13.492 --> 18:14.584
Tomari!

18:19.364 --> 18:20.422
Tomari...

18:25.204 --> 18:26.136
You...

18:28.540 --> 18:30.303
I need to talk to you.

18:30.409 --> 18:32.843
Talk? What is it?

18:32.978 --> 18:36.379
You're happy now, right?
What are you doing here...

18:36.515 --> 18:39.609
Don't laugh.
It's something important.

18:39.751 --> 18:41.018
<i>I want you to look this way.</i>

18:41.019 --> 18:42.043
<i>I want you to look this way.
Ouch...</i>

18:42.154 --> 18:43.553
What is it?

18:43.655 --> 18:44.644
Tomari!

18:44.857 --> 18:45.881
Yes?

18:46.792 --> 18:48.487
Um, I...

18:51.029 --> 18:54.328
Well, it's... Um... Well...

18:54.433 --> 18:55.422
What?

18:55.934 --> 19:00.428
I wanted to tell you my feelings...

19:01.240 --> 19:02.400
Your feelings?

19:03.142 --> 19:07.579
You see...
You're an important person to me.

19:08.547 --> 19:12.711
I want you to stay by
my side and be with me forever.

19:14.753 --> 19:18.553
<i>So I don't really know
how to say this, but...</i>

19:18.957 --> 19:20.618
I think I...

19:22.728 --> 19:25.219
Tomari, I think that I...

19:29.601 --> 19:31.364
Don't be silly.

19:32.738 --> 19:33.864
Tomari...

19:34.072 --> 19:36.666
You like Yasuna, right?

19:37.209 --> 19:39.973
You decided to be by her side, right?

19:42.748 --> 19:44.238
That's true...

19:44.483 --> 19:49.147
<i>I want to be by Yasuna's side. I want
to be with her. That's what I feel.</i>

19:49.388 --> 19:50.355
Then...

19:50.589 --> 19:53.854
But I don't want
to lose you because of that!

19:54.726 --> 19:57.820
<i>I don't want us to stop talking either!</i>

20:02.100 --> 20:03.658
But that's...

20:03.769 --> 20:06.465
Do you even know
what you're saying?

20:06.572 --> 20:08.096
I think I do!

20:08.207 --> 20:11.335
<i>But that's how I truly feel.</i>

20:12.611 --> 20:15.512
<i>I went to Yasuna's house today.</i>

20:16.281 --> 20:19.375
We were together,
and we tried to kiss...

20:20.886 --> 20:22.683
<i>But I couldn't do it.</i>

20:23.188 --> 20:26.157
<i>The promise I made with you...</i>

20:26.258 --> 20:27.691
Wait, Hazumu!

20:32.264 --> 20:33.925
Do you remember?

20:38.904 --> 20:41.429
If you can get to the other side?

20:41.540 --> 20:46.341
Yeah, if I can do it,
then can I be your groom?

20:48.880 --> 20:50.279
Can I?

20:52.251 --> 20:54.685
Yeah, sure...

20:54.953 --> 20:57.217
I'll be your bride!

21:02.394 --> 21:03.554
Hazumu...

21:06.832 --> 21:08.026
Hazumu...

21:15.007 --> 21:18.568
I can't escape...
There's no escaping now.

21:19.344 --> 21:20.538
Hazumu!

21:25.517 --> 21:26.449
Tomari...

21:28.987 --> 21:33.924
If what you just said is true, do
the same thing you did with Yasuna...

21:35.794 --> 21:38.160
The same thing?

21:43.135 --> 21:45.660
Well, that was...

21:47.239 --> 21:48.467
Tomari!

21:49.608 --> 21:53.738
Why are you nervous?
You're not manly at all.

21:54.112 --> 21:55.545
You're right.

21:55.681 --> 21:58.411
I can't be your groom like this.

21:58.617 --> 21:59.584
Oh...

22:00.118 --> 22:02.518
But I'm a girl now.

22:03.822 --> 22:07.155
I can be your bride now.

22:08.460 --> 22:09.757
You idiot.

22:10.262 --> 22:11.229
Yeah.

22:12.397 --> 22:13.955
I'll admit it.

22:14.433 --> 22:17.095
I love you, Hazumu.

22:24.343 --> 22:25.901
I love you...

22:27.112 --> 22:27.278
If it's a never-ending road...

22:27.279 --> 22:33.343
If it's a never-ending road...

22:34.119 --> 22:40.991
...then I can see you again someday.

22:41.159 --> 22:47.564
You're a weakling who tries
to hide things with your kindness.

22:47.866 --> 22:55.637
I'm sorry for making you look that way.

22:56.908 --> 23:03.438
Looking for the truth...
I was searching for...

23:03.915 --> 23:12.345
...the blue sky since that time.

23:13.392 --> 23:19.627
Let's overcome
the sadness and be happy.

23:20.298 --> 23:27.067
<i>Should I put my trust
in a future that I can't see?</i>

23:27.272 --> 23:36.943
<i>Your smiley face is about to cry...
I promise to turn it into something bright.</i>

23:37.182 --> 23:41.710
Don't let go of this hand.

23:44.623 --> 23:51.028
Our future is just around the corner.

23:56.301 --> 23:59.793
Summer's about the beaches.
Beaches are about bathing suits.

23:59.905 --> 24:01.896
What? Bento?

24:02.507 --> 24:04.702
Next time on Kashimashi
~Girl Meets Girl~.

24:04.810 --> 24:08.746
Heading to the Beach with Everyone.
These feelings... in my heart.
